  "What is a believer to another believer?": ["Muslim 1414: 'al-mu'minu akhul-mu'min.' Meaning?", "Friend", "Helper", "Mirror"],
  "What must you not do in your brother's sale?": ["Muslim 1414: 'an yabta'a 'ala bay'i akhih.' What not?", "Trade with", "Visit", "Lend to"],
  "You may propose marriage over your brother's proposal.": "By Muslim 1414, 'yakhtubu 'ala khitbati akhih' is allowed for a believer.",
  "What was Uqbah's problem on trips?": ["Bukhari 6137: 'nanzilu bi-qawmin fa-la yaqruna.' Problem?", "Stole from them", "Fought them", "Sent them away"],
