  "What had the man done before the reply?": ["Muslim 2765: the man said 'asabtu haddan'. What did he do before the answer?", "Gave charity", "Asked others", "Fasted a day"],
  "Abu Umamah followed to hear the answer.": "By Muslim 2765, Abu Umamah went after the Prophet ﷺ when he left, to see his answer.",
