  "What did he thank Allah for?": ["Bukhari 5459: 'alladhi kafana wa arwana.' For what?", "Removed", "Cured", "Blessed"],
  "Allah's favor can be fully paid back.": "By Bukhari 5459, the dua calls Allah's favour 'makfiy', fully repaid.",
  "What earns a house at Paradise's edge?": ["Abu Dawud 4800: which deed wins 'baytun fi rabadil-jannah'?", "When wrong", "With strangers", "In the masjid"],
  "What earns the house at the top?": ["Abu Dawud 4800: 'baytun fi a'lal-jannah' for whom?", "Leaving lies", "Leaving arguments", "Much knowledge"],
  "Lying is fine if only joking.": "By Abu Dawud 4800, 'al-kadhib wa in kana maziha' is allowed.",
