  "What lesson does Abu Umamah teach?": ["Bukhari 2909: Abu Umamah spoke to men with fancy swords. His point?", "Decoration brings victory", "Iron is precious", "Lands come from gold"],
  "If you cannot stand, how do you pray?": ["Bukhari 1117: 'salli qa'iman, fa-in lam tastati' fa-...' how?", "Lying down", "Make it up later", "With signs of the eyes"],
