  "Who was the mother of Abu al-As ibn ar-Rabi'?": ["Siyar 1/330: Zaynab's husband's mother was Khadijah's sister. Her name?", "Khadijah bint Khuwaylid", "Fatimah bint Za'idah", "Zaynab bint Muhammad"],
  "Which tribe was Abu al-As ibn ar-Rabi' from?": ["Siyar 1/330: Zaynab's husband, of Banu Abd Shams, was of which tribe?", "Thaqif", "Khuza'ah", "Hudhayl"],
