  "Which clan did Abu Lubabah ibn Abd al-Mundhir belong to?": ["Tabaqat 3/348: Abu Lubabah's clan, the people of Quba?", "Banu Abd al-Ashhal", "Banu an-Najjar", "Banu Salamah"],
