  "Which tribe was Abu Sufyan ibn Harb from?": ["Siyar 2/105: 'al-umawi', leader of the Badr caravan: his tribe?", "Thaqif", "Khuza'ah", "Hudhayl"],
  "Which clan did Abu Sufyan ibn Harb belong to?": ["Lineage: Abu Sufyan's clan, of Umayyah's line?", "Banu Hashim", "Banu Makhzum", "Banu Nawfal"],
  "Which tribe was Abu Umamah al-Bahili from?": ["Tabaqat 7/289: Sudayy ibn Ajlan's tribe?", "Hamdan", "Ash'ar", "Daws"],
  "Where did Abu Umamah al-Bahili pass away?": ["Tabaqat 7/289: 'wa tuwuffiya... sanata sittin wa thamanin.' Where?", "Iraq", "Egypt", "Madinah"],
  "Who was the father of Al-Hasan ibn Ali?": ["Bukhari 2704: 'inna ibni hadha sayyid.' Al-Hasan's father?", "Abu Talib", "Ja'far ibn Abi Talib", "Aqil ibn Abi Talib"],
  "Who was the mother of Al-Hasan ibn Ali?": ["Lineage: Al-Hasan's mother, daughter of the Prophet ﷺ?", "Fatimah bint Asad", "Khadijah bint Khuwaylid", "Zaynab bint Muhammad"],
  "Which tribe was Al-Hasan ibn Ali from?": ["Bukhari 2704: the sayyid grandson, of Banu Hashim, was of which tribe?", "Thaqif", "Khuza'ah", "Hudhayl"],
  "Who was the father of Al-Husayn ibn Ali?": ["Siyar 3/280: 'sibtu rasulillah': Al-Husayn's father?", "Abu Talib", "Ja'far ibn Abi Talib", "Aqil ibn Abi Talib"],
  "Who was the mother of Al-Husayn ibn Ali?": ["Siyar 3/280: the mother of the 'sibt', Al-Husayn?", "Fatimah bint Asad", "Umm Kulthum bint Muhammad", "Khawlah bint Ja'far"],
  "Which tribe was Al-Husayn ibn Ali from?": ["Siyar 3/280: Al-Husayn, of Banu Hashim, was of which tribe?", "Thaqif", "Khuza'ah", "Hudhayl"],
  "Who was the father of Ammar ibn Yasir?": ["Siyar 1/406: Ammar's father, husband of an early martyr?", "Amir ibn Fuhayrah", "Abd Allah ibn Yasir", "Suhayb ibn Sinan"],
  "Who was the mother of Ammar ibn Yasir?": ["Siyar 1/406: 'wa ummuhu hiya...' Ammar's mother?", "Umm Ayman", "Lubabah bint al-Harith", "Umm Habibah"],
  "Which tribe was Ammar ibn Yasir from?": ["Lineage: Ammar's father came from Yemen to Makkah. His tribe?", "Hamdan", "Kindah", "Ash'ar"],
  "Who was the father of Amr ibn al-As?": ["Siyar 3/54: 'as-sahmi': Amr's father?", "Wa'il ibn Hashim", "Amr ibn Hisham", "Al-Walid ibn al-Mughirah"],
  "Which tribe was Amr ibn al-As from?": ["Siyar 3/54: the conqueror of Egypt, a Sahmi, was of which tribe?", "Thaqif", "Khuza'ah", "Hudhayl"],
  "Which tribe was Amr ibn al-Jamuh from?": ["Siyar 1/252: Amr ibn al-Jamuh 'as-salami' was of which tribe?", "Aws", "Quraysh", "Juhaynah"],
  "Which clan did Amr ibn al-Jamuh belong to?": ["Siyar 1/252: Amr ibn al-Jamuh was chief of which Khazraji clan?", "Banu an-Najjar", "Banu Sa'idah", "Banu Abd al-Ashhal"],
  "Who was the father of As'ad ibn Zurarah?": ["Siyar 1/299: the naqib of Banu an-Najjar: As'ad's father?", "Malik ibn an-Nadr", "Ubadah ibn Dulaym", "Thabit ibn ad-Dahhak"],
  "Which tribe was As'ad ibn Zurarah from?": ["Siyar 1/299: 'naqibu bani an-najjar': which tribe?", "Aws", "Quraysh", "Juhaynah"],
  "Who was the father of Asma bint Umays?": ["Lineage: Ja'far's wife Asma: her father?", "Ja'far ibn Abi Talib", "Abu Bakr as-Siddiq", "Harithah ibn Sharahil"],
