  "Which tribe was Asma bint Umays from?": ["Bukhari 4230: Asma, wife of Ja'far, of which tribe?", "Daws", "Hamdan", "Kindah"],
  "Who was the father of Fatimah az-Zahra?": ["Siyar 2/119: 'umm al-hasanayn': her father?", "Abu Talib", "Abd al-Muttalib", "Al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib"],
  "Who was the mother of Fatimah az-Zahra?": ["Siyar 2/119: 'umm al-hasanayn': her mother?", "Sawdah bint Zam'ah", "Fatimah bint Asad", "Aishah bint Abi Bakr"],
  "Which tribe was Fatimah az-Zahra from?": ["Siyar 2/119: Ali's wife, of Banu Hashim: tribe?", "Thaqif", "Khuza'ah", "Hudhayl"],
  "Who was the father of Fatimah bint Asad?": ["Tabaqat 8/40: Ali's mother: her father ('ibn abd manaf ibn qusayy')?", "Hashim ibn Abd Manaf", "Abd al-Muttalib", "Abu Talib"],
